Subject: [PATCH] docs: record p1p3, the stock cfs_rq layout and container
 notes

Update the image and uname for boot_272_p1p3.img, document the CFS
pointer in the cfs_rq tail padding (vendor data stays at 344), the
0046-0048 fixes, the behavior-test results and the tcp_plb/net_cls/
CRIU/FHANDLE container notes.

